          "source": "https://github.com/Julian0444/desi-spectra-fm",
          "snippet": "In this project a catastrophic outlier is a prediction with |z_pred - z_true| / (1 + z_true) > 0.15, the eta metric reported for desi-fm (the DESI pipeline uses an equivalent velocity-error criterion). The dominant causes are line misidentification (the Halpha/[OII]/[OIII] single-line confusion), low signal-to-noise spectra, and sky-subtraction residuals mistaken for emission lines. desi-fm v2.1 f"
        }
      ]
